flowchart TD
    start([Packet enters WAN XDP])
    runtime{runtime_config valid?}
    parse{IPv4 parse result}
    service{Protected service match?}
    whitelist{Whitelist applies?}
    blacklist{Blacklist drop?}
    udp{UDP source port blocked?}
    neighbor{Neighbor resolved?}
    rule{Default rule applies?}
    rewrite{Rewrite Ethernet MACs}
    redirect{bpf_redirect_map tx_devmap}
    pass([XDP_PASS])
    drop([XDP_DROP])
    ok([XDP_REDIRECT])

    start --> runtime
    runtime -->|no| drop
    runtime -->|yes| parse
    parse -->|non IPv4| pass
    parse -->|malformed or fragment| drop
    parse -->|valid IPv4| service
    service -->|no| drop
    service -->|yes| whitelist
    whitelist -->|yes| neighbor
    whitelist -->|no| blacklist
    blacklist -->|yes| drop
    blacklist -->|no| udp
    udp -->|yes| drop
    udp -->|no| neighbor
    neighbor -->|no| drop
    neighbor -->|yes| rule
    rule -->|enforced drop/rate limit| drop
    rule -->|observe/sample/pass| rewrite
    rewrite -->|failed| drop
    rewrite -->|ok| redirect
    redirect -->|success| ok
    redirect -->|error| drop
